   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Hey Jude**: rare: 13 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2023-01-14.EJL95** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 201 min; rated 5/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: This is a very minimally mixed tape; the uploader plans a fully mixed version within days; Reviewer praises the sound quality of the recording; Reviewer says the recording makes them feel like they are back on the beach [1][2][4]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Taper's father phoned in to the radio show Tales from Golden Rd and announced the show had been posted [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2023-01-14.EJL95**: taped by Eric Lugassy; transferred by Eric Lugassy; source: Source: Channels 1 & 2 Line Audio OM1 Omnis 32\" Apart 90deg Left/ Right// Channels 3 & 4 Vanguard V1 Hypercardiods X/Y Center Channel // Chanel 5 & 6 Audio… [1]. Also: Recorded with six mics into a Zoom F6 at 32-bit float; workflow ran SD to WAV, Reaper, then 24-bit FLAC [1]",
